
  Welcome to Null Linux — an Arch-based security workstation

  Quick commands:
    null-setup           Choose and install tool sets
    null-toolkit list    Show roles and their real status
    null-repo status     Show third-party repository state
    null-install         Install Null Linux to disk
    sudo pacman -Syu     Full system upgrade

  Repositories: official Arch only. BlackArch and Chaotic-AUR are opt-in;
  see 'null-repo' and docs/package-sources.md.

  Docs: https://github.com/inilvinilra/NullLinux
